        "original_id": "516bf0b6-38dc-5bee-b50d-0dfebe23f465",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Dan Balan, T.I., Rihanna, Radu Sîrbu, Arsenie Todiraș\n- Groups: O-Zone\n- Songs: \"Live Your Life\"\n- Albums: Paper Trail\n\nFacts:\n- O-Zone was a Moldovan pop music trio active from 1998 to 2005.\n- O-Zone consisted of Dan Balan, Radu Sîrbu, and Arsenie Todiraș.\n- \"Live Your Life\" is a song by American rapper T.I. from his 2008 sixth studio album Paper Trail.\n- \"Live Your Life\" features Barbadian singer Rihanna.\n- Dan Balan was nominated for a Grammy as a co-writer of Rihanna and T.I.'s \"Live Your Life.\"\n- Dan Balan is the first and only Moldovan musician to receive a Grammy nomination.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
